@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
actor User
participant "Botox CLI" as CLI
participant "Kroki Service" as Kroki
participant "Embedded Typst" as Typst

User -> CLI : botox document.md
CLI -> Kroki : Render diagrams (if not cached)
Kroki --> CLI : SVG vector graphics
CLI -> Typst : Compile Markdown + SVGs
Typst --> CLI : PDF Document bytes
CLI --> User : Saved document.pdf
@enduml
